OL,3,GNEWSAFarm scraps Santa visit over
OL,4,Aplanning row
OL,5,
OL,6,FSanta's appearance at a children's farm
OL,7,Fhas been cancelled after the owners
OL,8,Fwere told they had broken planning
OL,9,Frules.
OL,11,FWhitehouse Farm, near Morpeth in
OL,12,FNorthumberland, told parents St Nick
OL,13,Fwould not attend its 2026 Christmas
OL,14,Fevent as it had been ordered to remove
OL,15,Fthe marquees where children would have
OL,16,Fmet him.
OL,18,FIn an email to customers, the farm said
OL,19,FNorthumberland County Council had
OL,20,Fissued it with a temporary stop notice
OL,21,Fon Friday demanding the tents be taken
OL,22,Fdown.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
