OL,3,GNEWSAFarm scraps Santa visit over
OL,4,Aplanning row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it had advised
OL,7,FWhitehouse Farm in September to cease
OL,8,Fworks and not advertise the Christmas
OL,9,Fevent until planning permission had
OL,10,Fbeen obtained.
